{"name":"Kitchen panelling, cooker hood and tall unit, Crouch End (standard sizes)","source":"Built in Trimble SketchUp through the connector (10 Oct 2026) from the job photos at standard sizes (nothing measured): the kitchen wall, 2700 to the ceiling. V-groove MDF (9 mm sheets, grooves every 125) on 44 x 18 battens from the 920 worktop to 2550 over a 3000 run; a 600 x 323 wall cupboard by the window with a panelled side and door; the cooker hood boxed in over the hob (a 940 x 493 ledge at 1550, a canopy narrowing to a 300 x 273 chimney up to 2550); a 600 x 600 tall unit at the end of the run with panelled sides, five shelves and a panelled door; on the dining side, V-groove panelling at dado height (1100) on battens, with a capping and a skirting. Walls, cornice, base units, worktop and hob are room context. No dimension lines. Read back face by face; units mm, X along the wall, Y out from the room, Z up.","materials":{"Wall":{"color":[236,234,228],"roughness":0.95},"Room: white woodwork":{"color":[246,245,240],"roughness":0.6},"Room: kitchen units":{"color":[176,186,170],"roughness":0.7},"Room: worktop":{"color":[200,160,110],"roughness":0.6},"Room: hob":{"color":[26,26,28],"roughness":0.3},"Batten":{"color":[204,174,124],"roughness":0.85},"V-groove MDF":{"color":[214,182,150],"roughness":0.85},"MDF 18 mm":{"color":[214,182,150],"roughness":0.85}},"moves":{"Wall cupboard: Door (hinged left)":{"hinge":{"origin":[2,-368,0],"axis":[0,0,-1],"angle":90},"at":[0.0,0.8]},"Tall unit: Door (hinged right)":{"hinge":{"origin":[3598,-618,0],"axis":[0,0,1],"angle":95},"at":[0.2,1.0]}},"view":{"yaw":-0.3,"pitch":0.2,"yawMin":-1.1,"yawMax":1.1,"pitchMin":0.0,"pitchMax":1.0},"actions":{"open":"Open the doors","close":"Close the doors"},"secs":1.4,"apart":["Panelling over the worktop","Wall cupboard","Cooker hood","Tall unit","Dining side panelling"],"geoms":{"g0":{"v":[-150,0,0,-150,150,0,5400,150,0,5400,0,0,-150,0,2700,5400,0,2700,5400,150,2700,-150,150,2700],"f":[[[0,1,2,3]],[[